.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# Quarto knitr-engine intermediate file (regenerated every render; normally
# auto-deleted on a clean render, but lingers if a render is interrupted)
*.rmarkdown

# knitr chunk cache (cache=TRUE chunks): large, regenerable, binary-diff-unfriendly.
# Kept local for fast re-renders; never committed. A fresh clone rebuilds it on
# the first render (which will be as slow as an uncached render).
*_cache/
